(7195340, 1107191, 96751, '<td valign="top">Adorable!  Very cool concept. The "pasted in" style is interesting but not terribly "realistic".  Some shading would definitely have helped in that direction, as well as the lighting on the boy, which is completely different from the rest of the image.</td>', 'Adorable!  Very cool concept. The "pasted in" style is interesting but not terribly "realistic".  Some shading would definitely have helped in that direction, as well as the lighting on the boy, which is completely different from the rest of the image.', '2014-03-28 16:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
