(7195345, 1107190, 96751, '<td valign="top">Samantha, I''m one of your biggest fans. But I''m not sure I get this image at all. I''m not only not understanding the good/bad news title (which seems to be based on "a penny for your thoughts"), I''m also seeing what appear to be several blatant editing mistakes: (ghosts on the side of the bowl, one of which the kitty is leaning on, but another one outside of that), the lip area doesn''t meet either on the left or the right....  All of these things are so outside your usually extraordinary attention to detail, it makes me wonder if you uploaded the wrong version.</td>', 'Samantha, I''m one of your biggest fans. But I''m not sure I get this image at all. I''m not only not understanding the good/bad news title (which seems to be based on "a penny for your thoughts"), I''m also seeing what appear to be several blatant editing mistakes: (ghosts on the side of the bowl, one of which the kitty is leaning on, but another one outside of that), the lip area doesn''t meet either on the left or the right....  All of these things are so outside your usually extraordinary attention to detail, it makes me wonder if you uploaded the wrong version.', '2014-03-28 16:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
