(7198736, 1107165, 117534, '<td valign="top">You are a Genius, an artist, a mind that well it''s just not normal LOL... Meant in a GOOD way!  You should be designing Book Covers, albums for rock stars !  My neighbor is a graphic artist, who illustrates books etc... He builds his stuff from scratch, and no limits like you deal with in DPC.  I am going to show him your work, can''t believe I haven''t before..  I have to thank you because you have pushed me in the expert edit end, Always going thru my mind is What is Christopher going to do and how can I stay in the same ball park as him!! LOL  Thanks again for a wonderful "story" a delight for my eye and senses, and Congrats on yet another blue masterpiece!!!!</td>', 'You are a Genius, an artist, a mind that well it''s just not normal LOL... Meant in a GOOD way!  You should be designing Book Covers, albums for rock stars !  My neighbor is a graphic artist, who illustrates books etc... He builds his stuff from scratch, and no limits like you deal with in DPC.  I am going to show him your work, can''t believe I haven''t before..  I have to thank you because you have pushed me in the expert edit end, Always going thru my mind is What is Christopher going to do and how can I stay in the same ball park as him!! LOL  Thanks again for a wonderful "story" a delight for my eye and senses, and Congrats on yet another blue masterpiece!!!!', '2014-04-04 12:31:27.000000', NULL, 0),
